""""Create like...": starting settings that give a script the feel of a real writing system (estimates from the reference
measurements, see docs/script-design.md section 27). A preset is a set of pinned dials; the seed still chooses everything
else, so one preset gives endless different scripts. Nothing is copied from the real script: only its structure and style."""
